{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17426","headline":"赠梁国惠康公主挽歌词二首 二 · 权德舆","name":"赠梁国惠康公主挽歌词二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"杳霭异湘川，飘颻驾紫烟。\n凤楼人已去，鸾镜月空悬。\n雾湿汤沐地，霜凝脂粉田。\n音容无处所，应在玉皇前。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17426.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17426","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}